Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): M148's WebUIURLLoaderFactory is still
constructed with `new` and has no base::SelfDeletingPassKey /
base::MakeSelfDeleting, so CreateForFrame, the new CreateForWorker and the
constructor are adapted to that idiom while adding the
request_initiator_origin_lock parameter and member exactly as upstream.
chrome/browser/chrome_content_browser_client.cc (not compiled by Electron)
took the upstream hunks as-is. The unittest hunks did not apply and were
dropped. Electron's own caller in shell/browser/electron_browser_client.cc
is updated in a separate commit.

Electron adaptation notes (42-x-y): M148's WebUIURLLoaderFactory is still
constructed with `new` and has no base::SelfDeletingPassKey /
base::MakeSelfDeleting, so CreateForFrame, the new CreateForWorker and the
constructor are adapted to that idiom while adding the
request_initiator_origin_lock parameter and member exactly as upstream.
chrome/browser/chrome_content_browser_client.cc (not compiled by Electron)
took the upstream hunks as-is. The unittest hunks did not apply and were
dropped. Electron's own caller in shell/browser/electron_browser_client.cc
is updated in a separate commit.
Build fix-up: M148's WebUIDataSourceImpl has no resources_frozen_ state, so the two CHECK(!resources_frozen_) lines in SetAllowAllOrigins / AddAccessControlAllowOrigin are dropped.

